    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent online type foundry (GUNMAD design studio's type venture), founded 2013 by Gudmundur Ulfarsson (Reykjavik) and Mads Freund Brunse (London). Notable typefaces include Separat, Forzata, Similar, La Pontaise, Or Lemmen, Landnama, Rather, Boogie School Sans; work has appeared on Foam and The Wire magazine covers, the 2015 Sundance Film Festival identity and Icelandic national football jerseys. Small, senior two-person practice, both founders are established graphic designers/typographers (GUNMAD studio also does client identity and web work). No Autonomy set, this is an org entry led by two experienced principals rather than a single founder.",
